Source version: commit 8c279f05df6441b0c8121332aaba12ecf2f845ba (7 October 2026), specification v1.0.
The source repository contains no NOTICE file.

This is an independent guide. It is not an official part of
the source project and is not endorsed by OpenA2A.

Changes from the source:
1. The main concepts are written again in Simplified Technical English.
2. Three new diagrams (assets/).
3. A new agent skill (SKILL.md) that applies the specification to one agent.
4. The specification, control definitions, and templates are not copied;
   the skill refers to them by their paths in the source repository.
5. The note about agents that can edit their own SOUL.md (README and SKILL.md)
   is the author's own observation, not part of the source.

